id: S09
target: src/sello/scalar.nim
desc: cmovCached: operator swap in the branchless absolute-value formula, '(digit xor signMask) - signMask' -> '... + signMask'.
====OLD====
  let absDigit = (digit xor signMask) - signMask  # branchless abs
====NEW====
  let absDigit = (digit xor signMask) + signMask  # branchless abs
====END====
